# WhyCon synthetic perception bench (TD-S10) — only the canonical
# 368-frame run 20260523_133537 is kept in git.  Smaller smoke/30/100
# iterations are regenerable via
# sim/scripts/generate_whycon_synthetic_dataset.py.  Preview PNGs and
# validator overlays are derived from canonical PGM frames + manifest
# via sim/scripts/validate_whycon_synthetic_dataset.py.
dataset/TD-S10-B*/whycon_gazebo_synth_*/preview/
dataset/TD-S10-B*/whycon_gazebo_synth_*/_work/
dataset/TD-S10-B*/whycon_gazebo_synth_*/validation_*/overlays/
